#: settings/kcm_bookmarks.cpp:99
msgid ""
"<h1>My Bookmarks</h1>"
"<p>This module lets you configure your cache settings.</p>"
"<p>The cache is an internal memory in Konqueror where recently read web pages are stored. If you want to retrieve a web page again that you have recently read, it will not be downloaded from the Internet, but rather retrieved from the cache, which is a lot faster.</p>"
msgstr ""
